### StoreRate API — REST Client requests
### Install the free "REST Client" extension by Huachao Mao in VS Code first.
### Then just click "Send Request" above each block below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = paste_your_token_here_after_login

### 1. Login — Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@storerate.com",
  "password": "Admin@1234"
}

### 1b. Login — Store Owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@storerate.com",
  "password": "Owner@1234"
}

### 1c. Login — Normal User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "moresharayu345@gmail.com",
  "password": "Sharayu@345"
}

### 2. Signup (normal user)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A Name At Least Twenty Characters",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "address": "123 Test Street"
}

### 3. Admin Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. List Users (with filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?name=&email=&address=&role=&sortBy=name&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Add User
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "A Name At Least Twenty Characters",
  "email": "newadmin@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!",
  "address": "123 Test Street",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 6. List Stores (admin view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stores?name=&email=&address=&sortBy=name&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Add Store
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/stores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Sample New Store",
  "email": "samplenew@example.com",
  "address": "456 Market Road, Mumbai",
  "ownerId": null
}

### 8. List Stores (user view, with search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stores?name=&address=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Submit / Update Rating (Zebra Bakery, id 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/stores/2/ratings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "rating": 4
}

### 10. Owner Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/owner/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
